{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_7bmjfktnq3wqo4ju5lyuoiqlbjzogtvf54ab5yxolzsrvhbqqd2q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01UDt1kzpLLDT3yhGpmo1mPs","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"fileKey":"MBJGR6pcP8R2URhIN3ARYg","description":"Read all text on Start Here and Foundations pages","code":"const out=[];\nfor (const id of ['0:1','1:2','6:2']) {\n  const p = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);\n  await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(p);\n  out.push('=== '+p.name+' children:'+p.children.length);\n  for (const c of p.children) out.push(`[${c.type}] ${c.id} ${c.name} ${Math.round(c.x)},${Math.round(c.y)} ${Math.round(c.width)}x${Math.round(c.height)}`);\n  const texts = p.findAllWithCriteria({types:['TEXT']});\n  for (const t of texts) out.push(t.id+': '+t.characters);\n}\nreturn out.join('\\n');"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":971,"cache_read_input_tokens":7917,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":971,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"624c2a9a-654c-44d2-8d05-3d341d78f1b2","uuid":"63e8f2cd-398e-4173-ade5-9ecc80bcc661","timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:32:36.956Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01UDt1kzpLLDT3yhGpmo1mPs","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01UDt1kzpLLDT3yhGpmo1mPs","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 00 · Start Here 设计任务 children:1\n[FRAME] 5:2 Start Here · Brief 0,0 1440x2852\n5:4: LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\n5:5: Payment Wallet — pay, manage, grow\n5:6: Design a mobile payment wallet: onboard, start with a phone number, see your bank balances and recent transactions, and reach the main areas from the side menu. Canvas 390 × 844, iPhone. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\n5:8: How to work\n5:9: 1. Build exactly the 4 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links.\n2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions.\n3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently.\n4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator, system numeric keypad). Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file.\n5. Use the illustration, avatars, bank and merchant marks and icons from 04 · Media.\n6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\n5:11: Frames · goals · must include · links\n5:12: Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\n5:15: 01_Onboarding\n5:16: Goal: Understand the app and choose to start.\n5:17: MUST INCLUDE\n5:18: • Actions: “Get Started” · “Sign in”\n• Copy: “Pay / Manage / Grow…” (one word per line) · “An easy app to manage all your payment and finance-related needs” · “Already have an account?”\n• Media: Illustration_Onboarding\n5:19: LINKS\n5:20: → Get Started → 02_Phone_Number\n5:22: 02_Phone_Number\n5:23: Goal: Enter a phone number to get started.\n5:24: MUST INCLUDE\n5:25: • Actions: “Cancel” · “Get Started”\n• Form: “Phone Number” · country code +91 · empty (placeholder 9812345678) · focused\n• Header: “Get Started” · “Please enter the mobile phone number”\n• Keyboard: system numeric keypad open (Numeric Keypad)\n• Presentation: sheet over 01_Onboarding\n5:26: LINKS\n5:27: → Get Started → 03_Home\n→ Cancel → 01_Onboarding\n5:29: 03_Home\n5:30: Goal: Check my balances, move money and see recent transactions.\n5:31: MUST INCLUDE\n5:32: • Accounts: Axis Bank · HDFC Bank · Deutsche Bank · Union Bank, each with its mark and balance (see DATA)\n• Actions: “Send” (Icon_Send) · “Receive” (Icon_Receive) · refresh balance (Icon_Refresh) · “Transaction History” · “Scan any QR” (Icon_Scan)\n• Balance: Bank_HSBC · “Last Updated Balance” · ₹85,625 · “Primary” (Icon_Check_Badge)\n• Header: Avatar_Hallie_Goebel (opens the menu) · search “Pay by name or phone” (Icon_Search) · history (Icon_History)\n• Offer: “Invite friends and get ₹1,000 reward” (Icon_Offer)\n• Transactions: “RECENT TRANSACTIONS” · 3 rows (see DATA)\n5:33: LINKS\n5:34: → avatar → 04_Menu\n5:36: 04_Menu\n5:37: Goal: Reach the main areas of the app.\n5:38: MUST INCLUDE\n5:39: • Account: Avatar_Hallie_Goebel · “Hallie Goebel” · hallie.goebel@example.com\n• Actions: “Logout” (Icon_Logout)\n• Menu: New Payment (Icon_New_Payment) · Bank Accounts (Icon_Bank) · All Transactions (Icon_History) · Rewards & Offers (Icon_Offer) · Settings (Icon_Settings) — source order\n• Presentation: side menu over 03_Home, with 03_Home still partly visible\n5:40: LINKS\n5:41: → tap the visible part of 03_Home → 03_Home\n5:43: Navigation structure\n5:44: • Onboarding: 01_Onboarding → Get Started → 02_Phone_Number (sheet over 01) → Get Started → 03_Home; Cancel → 01.\n• 04_Menu is a side menu opened from the avatar on 03_Home. There is no tab bar in this task.\n• Entry only (no frame): Sign in, search, history, refresh, account tiles, Send, Receive, reward banner, transaction rows, Transaction History, Scan any QR, menu rows, Logout.\n5:46: Fixed data & copy\n5:47: Use these values verbatim.\n5:50: User\n5:51: Hallie Goebel · hallie.goebel@example.com · Avatar_Hallie_Goebel\n5:53: Primary account\n5:54: HSBC (Bank_HSBC) · Last Updated Balance ₹85,625 · Primary\n5:56: Other accounts (source order)\n5:57: Axis Bank ₹3,500 (Bank_Axis)\nHDFC Bank ₹63,520 (Bank_HDFC)\nDeutsche Bank ₹36,258 (Bank_Deutsche)\nUnion Bank ₹67,820 (Bank_Union)\n5:59: Recent transactions (newest first)\n5:60: Paytm Auto Pay · 22 Jan · Weekly transaction · −₹3,500 (Merchant_Paytm)\nRisa Midyett · 05 Jan · Gift for Christmas · +₹6,950 (Avatar_Risa_Midyett)\nAmazon Pantry · 01 Jan · Subscription payment · −₹1,200 (Merchant_Amazon)\n5:62: Reward\n5:63: Invite friends and get ₹1,000 reward\n5:65: Phone sign-up\n5:66: Country code +91 · field empty, placeholder 9812345678\n5:68: Menu (source order)\n5:69: New Payment · Bank Accounts · All Transactions · Rewards & Offers · Settings · Logout\n5:71: What is fixed · what is yours\n5:74: Fixed (given)\n5:75: • Frame list and exact names\n• Must-include content per frame (what, not how)\n• Navigation structure and links\n• All data and copy\n• Brand color #1E32FA and Inter\n• Media: illustration, avatars, bank and merchant marks, icons\n• Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell incl. numeric keypad\n5:77: Yours (designer decides)\n5:78: • Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen\n• All other colors: neutrals, text, backgrounds / surfaces, Send / Receive, positive / negative amounts, reward banner, error / disabled\n• Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation\n• All states: focused field, primary account, pressed, disabled\n• Headers, sheet, 