{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_usvwdkxqmnkoh6p24sovqf32vm7c63rtgok66577qo3bt3fjyonq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've built all 4 screens in **03 · Workspace**, with the component library and the clickable prototype. I checked every screen in a screenshot. The account is confirmed as zuohaosheng@tetras.ai.\n\n**File:** https://www.figma.com/design/MBJGR6pcP8R2URhIN3ARYg/\n**03 · Workspace page ID:** `6:2`\n\n| Screen | ID | What's on it |\n|---|---|---|\n| 01_Onboarding | `17:118` | Brand-blue screen with Illustration_Onboarding, the headline \"Pay / Manage / Grow…\" (one word per line), the description, a white \"Get Started\" button and \"Already have an account? Sign in\" |\n| 02_Phone_Number | `18:132` | A sheet over a dimmed copy of 01. It has the header (\"Get Started\", \"Please enter the mobile phone number\", \"Cancel\"), the Phone Number field in its focused state (+91, empty with placeholder 9812345678, blue border and cursor), \"Get Started\" and the system numeric keypad open |\n| 03_Home | `19:195` | Avatar, the \"Pay by name or phone\" search and a history button; the HSBC balance card (Last Updated Balance ₹85,625, Primary badge, refresh); Send and Receive; the 4 other accounts with their marks and balances; the reward banner; RECENT TRANSACTIONS with \"Transaction History\" and the 3 rows; \"Scan any QR\" |\n| 04_Menu | `19:352` | Side menu with avatar, Hallie Goebel and hallie.goebel@example.com, the 5 menu items in source order, and Logout. A scaled-down 03_Home stays partly visible on the right |\n\n03_Home is 390 × 1040 instead of 844 tall, so the whole screen shows in one view. It's set to scroll vertically and the status bar stays fixed at the top. All copy and amounts match the brief, including the \"−\" minus sign.\n\n**Prototype:** the flow starts at 01_Onboarding, and all five links are confirmed:\n- Get Started (01) → 02_Phone_Number, sliding up like a sheet\n- Get Started (02) → 03_Home\n- Cancel (02) → 01_Onboarding\n- Avatar (03) → 04_Menu\n- Tapping the visible part of Home (04) → 03_Home\n\n**Design system:** a board titled \"Design System · Payment Wallet\", placed below the screens, shows the colors, type scale, radii and shadows. The reusable components on it are:\n- **Wrapping the supplied parts:** Button (Primary or white, each in default, pressed and disabled), built on the given Button; and Phone Field (default, focused, filled, error, disabled), built on the given Text Field.\n- **Business components:** Link, Icon Button, Primary badge, Search Bar, Home and Sheet headers, circular marks made from the Media assets, Balance Card, Send/Receive buttons, Account Tile, Reward Banner, Section Header, Transaction Row (debit and credit), Scan Button, Menu Item and Side Menu.\n\nAll images and icons are instances from 04 · Media, with the icons recolored. Brand color #1E32FA and Inter are used throughout. The reference pages were only read, not changed.\n\n**Limitations:**\n- The phone field is empty, as the brief requires, but \"Get Started\" on 02 is still shown as active so the link to 03_Home can be clicked. The disabled button state exists only on the component board.\n- The Home preview inside 04_Menu is a static copy of 03_Home, so it won't pick up later edits to 03_Home automatically.\n- The entry-only items (Sign in, search, history, refresh, account tiles, Send, Receive, banner, rows, Transaction History, Scan any QR, menu rows, Logout) have no links, as the brief specifies."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1168,"cache_read_input_tokens":83118,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1168,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"624c2a9a-654c-44d2-8d05-3d341d78f1b2","uuid":"93804ad4-78e4-4dd7-9220-